  "local_changes": [
    "Removed the itch.io embed tracking/hotlink script from index.html for standalone local use.",
    "Formatted index.html for readability.",
    "Added controls.js: scroll up holds S, scroll down holds W, releasing 180 ms after the final wheel event.",
    "Added a 50 ms primary-click debounce; secondary-click/context-menu gestures cancel pending primary presses, with a short secondary-click cooldown and focus cleanup.",
    "Added lifecycle.js to pause the Emscripten main loop, suspend game audio, and stop periodic saves when the page is hidden or unfocused; resume on return and save once on leaving.",
    "Added independent horizontal scroll turning through original Z/C turn bindings; physical C/T/Z remap to original X/Backspace/LeftBracket for crouch, weapon equip/unequip, and zoom. Other keys pass through.",
    "Inverted horizontal scrolling; reduced turn input to one-third duty cycle; require horizontal motion at least twice vertical motion to turn, otherwise favor forward/back movement.",
    "Replaced pulsed scrolling turns with continuous key holds at axis speed 50 (original 150). Before main(), update the browser User.ini turn aliases and F=PutInHand, T=PrevBeltItem, Y=NextBeltItem, R=ReloadWeapon while preserving other settings. C/Z shim mappings remain.",
    "Scroll axes now hold and release independently, allowing simultaneous forward/back movement and turning on diagonal gestures.",
    "Swapped T/Y: T selects next item; Y selects previous item."
  ],
